!Sample_molecule_ch1 = genomic DNA
!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = For Library, just used plasmid pool as PCR template; For input cell pool, extracted genomic DNA was used as PCR template; For tumor samples, homogenated tumor and extracted genomic DNA, and then used as PCR template.
!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = For Library, just amplified sgRNA pool from the plasmid pool; For Input cell pool, amplified sgRNA pool from genomic DNA; For samples from treatment groups, amplified sgRNA pool from genomic DNAs.
!Sample_description = CRISPR Screen
!Sample_description = Amplified sgRNA pools
!Sample_data_processing = The adaptor sequences were trimmed using cutadapt (v1.18) and the untrimmed reads were removed.
!Sample_data_processing = gRNAs were mapped to the annotation file and read count tables were made.
!Sample_data_processing = MAGeCK (0.5.8) was used to normalize the count table based on median normalization and fold changes and the significance of the changes in the conditions were calculated for genes and sgRNAs.
!Sample_data_processing = Genome_build: mm10
!Sample_data_processing = Supplementary_files_format_and_content: *.txt: Tab-delimited text files include read counts.
