!Sample_growth_protocol_ch1 = KP-Cas9 cells were transfected with lentivirus pool (MOI=0.2), and selected by using 5ug/ml Blasticidin, and the cultured for 2 weeks for expanding. At week 2, harvested part of the cell pool as input ctrl, and subcutaneously injected cell pool to into the B6 Rag1-/- mice and B6 WT mice to form tumors. Then performed 3 weeks' treatment and harvest tumors.
!Sample_molecule_ch1 = genomic DNA
!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = For Library, just used plasmid pool as PCR template; For input cell pool, extracted genomic DNA was used as PCR template; For tumor samples, homogenated tumor and extracted genomic DNA, and then used as PCR template.
!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = For Library, just amplied sgRNA pool from the plasmid pool; For Input cell pool, amplied sgRNA pool from genomic DNA; For samples from treatment groups, amplied sgRNA pool from genomic DNAs.
!Sample_description = Amplified sgRNA pools
!Sample_data_processing = Library strategy: CRISPR Screen
!Sample_data_processing = The adaptor sequences were trimmed using cutadapt (v1.18) and the untrimmed reads were removed
!Sample_data_processing = gRNAs were mapped to the annotation file and read count table were made
!Sample_data_processing = MAGeCK (0.5.8) [3] was used to normalize the count table based on median normalization and fold changes and the significance of the changes in the conditions were calculated for genes and sgRNAs.
!Sample_data_processing = Supplementary_files_format_and_content: read count
